            "question": "How does the membership work?",
            "answer": "<p>$50 to join, which includes your first month. Then $20 a month until you cancel. Each paid month's $20 becomes 20 credits; one credit is $1 to spend on anything in the house. The joining fee does not add credits.</p>",
